Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.56,0:00:03.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切开始于神木
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.66,0:00:05.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不断战斗 不断祈求 不断寻找
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.63,0:00:07.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从中产生了强烈的羁绊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.47,0:00:08.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全新的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.47,0:00:10.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光明的未来从现在开始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.71,0:00:12.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与奈落的战斗结束后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.37,0:00:14.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原本关系应该更加和谐的两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.51,0:00:15.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却由于弥勒法师的缘故
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.91,0:00:18.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两人的关系出现了裂痕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.51,0:00:20.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样子真的好吗 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.78,0:00:22.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,引导我们的最后一块碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.52,0:00:24.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枯井的另一边 战国的世界里还有明天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.95,0:00:26.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战国时代的传奇故事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.15,0:00:26.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.29,0:00:34.25,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为谁而流的眼泪 祈祷般地流下脸颊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.40,0:00:41.49,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要隐藏脆弱 温柔地接受
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.04,0:00:49.00,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连呼吸都忘记 眼中的天空{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.18,0:00:55.98,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唯有太阳闪耀着 不断寻找着什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.08,0:01:03.32,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凝视镜子 你一定能看见立誓的那天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.86,0:01:10.66,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己的背后也有翅膀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.97,0:01:16.63,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的改变将改变世界{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.74,0:01:20.00,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实现梦想的爱的火焰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.17,0:01:27.08,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿越虚幻的海市蜃楼{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.52,0:01:31.28,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天空有光 大地有水
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.45,0:01:40.85,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坚强的心灵带你到未来的 ANGELUS（奉告祈祷）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.20,0:01:48.19,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,双手握紧热情的碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.15,0:02:06.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师还在沮丧耶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.52,0:02:08.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为被扒手扒走了钱包吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.52,0:02:11.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 都是我的错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.69,0:02:12.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.53,0:02:15.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别这么沮丧了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.70,0:02:17.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.13,0:02:21.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要对我说这么贴心的话好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.10,0:02:23.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.74,0:02:27.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我实在没有办法原谅自己这么粗心犯下的错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.58,0:02:29.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.68,0:02:34.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是沮丧的表现吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.82,0:02:37.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说的和做的完全两回事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.52,0:02:41.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第161话 弥勒法师的陈年旧帐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.36,0:02:50.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是向得道高僧求来的灵符
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.43,0:02:52.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用这个的话一定能够镇得住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.44,0:03:01.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地震
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.18,0:03:01.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.04,0:03:02.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.48,0:03:04.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.75,0:03:08.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请您原谅
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.42,0:03:10.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请您原谅啊 湖神大人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.62,0:03:15.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.76,0:03:20.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来好像是为了什么怪异的事情在烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.13,0:03:21.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果您不介意
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.46,0:03:22.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们愿意助您一臂之力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.43,0:03:25.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥…弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.23,0:03:28.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.07,0:03:32.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您真的要按照约定入赘到我们家吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.11,0:03:35.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,入赘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.78,0:03:38.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.58,0:03:40.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点准备招待法师
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.62,0:03:43.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.08,0:03:45.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.42,0:03:46.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想不起来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.96,0:03:50.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该说同样的事要想起来会太多了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.46,0:03:53.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.66,0:03:55.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在等您回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.64,0:04:04.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,志麻姑娘 你真是越来越美了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.47,0:04:05.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好高兴喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.51,0:04:14.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷静一点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.02,0:04:16.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是过去的事了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.02,0:04:17.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.69,0:04:19.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们夫妻本来也以为这件事已经过去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.02,0:04:21.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打算放弃了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.02,0:04:23.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的女儿志麻
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.32,0:04:25.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自幼就是体弱多病的体质
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.76,0:04:28.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能过着终日卧床不起的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.03,0:04:32.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时候弥勒法师正好路过我们这里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.60,0:04:34.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那已经是两年前的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.40,0:04:37.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请将这种药草以清水煎煮后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.04,0:04:39.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每天服用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.47,0:04:42.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不愧是昂贵的药草
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.91,0:04:44.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,疗效果然非凡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.85,0:04:47.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的是非常昂贵的药草
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.62,0:04:51.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又坑了别人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.12,0:04:54.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来 两个人的感情越来越好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.86,0:04:55.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.92,0:04:58.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师给了我们药草之后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.23,0:04:59.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就匆匆离去了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.63,0:05:01.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.80,0:05:03.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是清白的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.20,0:05:05.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.57,0:05:06.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.23,0:05:08.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你康复之后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.50,0:05:10.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以为我生孩子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.74,0:05:11.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.01,0:05:14.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贵重的药草
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.71,0:05:16.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以及分别时跟弥勒法师之间的约定
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.01,0:05:18.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成为我心灵的支柱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.95,0:05:20.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来我果然彻底康复了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.38,0:05:24.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你果然又是在追求人家嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.15,0:05:28.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好啊 反正都是过去的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:30.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 无聊死了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.76,0:05:32.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种事情怎样都无所谓吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.96,0:05:34.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会无所谓啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.53,0:05:36.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倒是刚才说的怪异的事 是怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.23,0:05:38.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:40.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才在祠堂那边发生的事…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.90,0:05:44.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又有地震耶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.91,0:05:46.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好怕喔 弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.54,0:05:52.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我害怕的是另外一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.68,0:05:56.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 请您一定要救救我们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.12,0:06:00.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再这么下去 女儿就要成为妖怪的新娘了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.62,0:06:01.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成为妖怪的新娘
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.06,0:06:03.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是…是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.69,0:06:06.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那座祠堂 是用来祭祀湖神大人的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.93,0:06:10.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个湖神大人说无论如何一定要志麻嫁给他
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.63,0:06:15.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也跟他说我已经有了未婚夫 但他就是不相信
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.81,0:06:20.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问 未婚夫是指…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.77,0:06:21.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不就是指你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.51,0:06:29.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是弥勒法师并没有忘记跟我的约定而回来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.88,0:06:32.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是多么期盼着这一天的到来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.46,0:06:37.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.09,0:06:38.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.03,0:06:41.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不能把志麻姑娘交给那个妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.46,0:06:43.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您愿意帮助我们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.30,0:06:44.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事就交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.40,0:06:46.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么马上举办婚礼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.67,0:06:52.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不是要我们把妖怪除掉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.24,0:06:56.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来对方不论怎样都想生下弥勒的孩子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.82,0:07:07.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,志麻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.75,0:07:11.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天晚上就是约定的日子咯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.07,0:07:21.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好冷喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.20,0:07:26.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么只有弥勒留在房子里面呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.01,0:07:27.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.14,0:07:29.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他好像说有事要商量
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.51,0:07:32.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拒绝当入赘的女婿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.01,0:07:34.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是当然的咯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.88,0:07:37.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为弥勒法师已经跟珊瑚订下婚约了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.39,0:07:41.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以相信那个家伙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.72,0:07:42.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可是弥勒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.36,0:07:45.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,送到嘴边不吃是男人的耻辱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.66,0:07:46.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你给我坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.03,0:07:54.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么时候学会说这种坏话的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.60,0:07:57.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且要说也要顺便看看场合啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.04,0:07:59.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺便什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.48,0:08:05.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很希望您能够尽早和我女儿完婚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.81,0:08:09.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是想抢走志麻姑娘的湖神大人是妖怪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.48,0:08:12.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管志麻姑娘是否嫁给他人为妻
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.19,0:08:13.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也都会来抢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.92,0:08:15.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算举办婚礼也没用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.92,0:08:17.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 正是时候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.93,0:08:19.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,湖神大人说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.39,0:08:21.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要一个清纯的少女来当他的新娘
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.33,0:08:26.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以如果举行了婚礼的话 他就不得不放弃了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.50,0:08:28.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他这么重礼教啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.64,0:08:30.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎么样 在湖神大人来这里之前
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.64,0:08:32.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请让我成为弥勒法师的妻子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.61,0:08:34.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,志麻姑娘…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.11,0:08:37.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,送到嘴边的肉不吃 可是男人的耻辱哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.91,0:08:39.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.92,0:08:46.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥…勒…法…师… 怪…怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.69,0:08:49.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 你在干什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.29,0:08:54.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是试着把珊瑚的心情表现出来而已
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.49,0:08:55.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才没有生气呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.30,0:09:00.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 打扰你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.64,0:09:02.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧 混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.44,0:09:09.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她的眼睛好像是在说“去死吧 混蛋”
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.54,0:09:12.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.45,0:09:13.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那位女客人是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.55,0:09:16.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 不瞒您说…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.05,0:09:18.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又有地震
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.05,0:09:21.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还是个带着腥味的家伙接近了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.66,0:09:25.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照这么看起来\N好像是那个叫什么湖神大人的驾临了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.24,0:09:38.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是湖神大人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.71,0:09:41.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,依照约定 我来迎娶志麻姑娘为我的妻子了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.48,0:09:43.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然他这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.84,0:09:45.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这个家伙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.45,0:09:47.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他已经自报姓名了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.32,0:09:55.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.86,0:09:58.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要来阻碍我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.49,0:10:00.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人家那位姑娘不愿意啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.40,0:10:02.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,湖…湖神大人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.10,0:10:04.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 好可怕喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.10,0:10:06.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的有那么可怕吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.87,0:10:08.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,志麻姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.37,0:10:09.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.27,0:10:13.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看吧 死心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.14,0:10:15.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为…为什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.74,0:10:18.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是已经清清楚楚约定好要嫁给我了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.71,0:10:19.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约定好？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.01,0:10:21.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才没有跟你约定好什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.29,0:10:27.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请您原谅我 湖神大人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.62,0:10:28.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父亲大人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.99,0:10:29.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老实说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.09,0:10:33.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为要煎煮那么贵重的药
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.89,0:10:36.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请将这种药草以清水煎煮后
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.50,0:10:37.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每天服用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.40,0:10:41.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是用湖中的水来煎煮药的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.90,0:10:42.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且因为顺路
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.90,0:10:46.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我每天都到湖的祠堂许下愿望
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.24,0:10:51.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,湖神大人啊 请治好我女儿的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.14,0:10:53.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管您要我们怎么报答您都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.78,0:10:57.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我作梦也没想到这些话真的被湖神大人听见了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.45,0:11:01.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因此湖神大人说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.66,0:11:04.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让志麻姑娘嫁给他以作为报答吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.19,0:11:07.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道说这件事会是我的错吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.89,0:11:09.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么觉得他有点可怜耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.30,0:11:12.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一点都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.40,0:11:15.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父亲竟然许下了那样的约定
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.67,0:11:17.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,志麻 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.47,0:11:18.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.47,0:11:21.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为您一心一意盼着我的病能够治得好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.18,0:11:23.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.58,0:11:25.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是没办法的事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.55,0:11:26.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然说我事先不知情
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.05,0:11:28.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是约定就是约定
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.48,0:11:30.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也就是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.58,0:11:31.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,志麻姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.69,0:11:34.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会真的想嫁给这个妖怪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.46,0:11:37.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,湖神大人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.43,0:11:42.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.96,0:11:46.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我根本就没有成为湖神大人新娘的资格
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.17,0:11:48.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.94,0:11:49.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.84,0:11:53.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,湖神大人您希望娶一个清纯的少女作为新娘
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.81,0:11:57.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我已经在两年前
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.85,0:12:01.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟这位弥勒法师结合为夫妇了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.08,0:12:05.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真…真的是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.85,0:12:06.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,志麻
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.62,0:12:08.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 父亲大人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.52,0:12:10.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事我实在无法说出口
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.72,0:12:12.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早料到了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.36,0:12:15.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是就算改口这样说 还是觉得很震惊耶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.86,0:12:20.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好啊 已经是过去的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.00,0:12:21.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,湖神大人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.00,0:12:23.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这么一回事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.14,0:12:26.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请您当作没有发生过这件事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.24,0:12:30.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们欺骗了我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.62,0:12:43.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所谓爱越深恨越深
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.02,0:12:44.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大鲶鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.86,0:12:48.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要让你们这些家伙体会一下我的悲伤
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.40,0:12:52.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的房子就快要被毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.53,0:12:54.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 救救我们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.77,0:12:56.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了 让我们来镇住它
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.27,0:12:58.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们上 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.94,0:13:02.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一个人去收拾吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.64,0:13:05.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是你以前犯的错吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.58,0:13:08.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请…请问…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.38,0:13:12.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位女客人也要开始变身了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.02,0:13:15.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不…她不是妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.82,0:13:17.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不是争论的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.96,0:13:19.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的房子…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.53,0:13:25.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的对手是我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.97,0:13:27.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要一口把你吃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.20,0:13:30.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 听我说你就明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.07,0:13:32.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离我远一点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.11,0:13:37.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来我们果然是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.58,0:13:40.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.28,0:13:43.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那两个人会变得怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.35,0:13:47.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.29,0:13:50.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在应该是要看犬夜叉跟大鲶鱼那边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.22,0:14:00.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟敢把我当傻瓜一样耍
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.96,0:14:02.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少自大了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.83,0:14:08.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.43,0:14:11.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还想打的话 我也要动真格的了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.64,0:14:18.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,志麻姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.11,0:14:21.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来是这么的相信你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.08,0:14:23.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他镇静下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.01,0:14:25.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,湖神大人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.98,0:14:29.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在是不是已经对我死心了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.59,0:14:34.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样就没有啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.96,0:14:37.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 就算杀了这个家伙也会睡得不安稳
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.66,0:14:42.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 那边的事态好像越来越严重了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.37,0:14:44.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么 还在吵啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.24,0:14:47.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.64,0:14:50.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你连我的话都不想听了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.91,0:14:53.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.14,0:14:54.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都不想管了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.98,0:14:55.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.61,0:14:58.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个弥勒花心又好色的毛病
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.65,0:15:01.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又不是从今天昨天才开始的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.15,0:15:02.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.62,0:15:03.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.52,0:15:06.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 你真的一点都不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.39,0:15:08.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果过去曾经跟对方交往过的女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.26,0:15:09.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出现在自己的面前
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.79,0:15:11.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心情怎么可能会好嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.26,0:15:15.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那…那个 请你们不要吵架
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.40,0:15:16.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,志麻姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.37,0:15:18.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一切都是我不好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.77,0:15:20.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你不要责怪弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.94,0:15:25.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.94,0:15:26.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别过来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.01,0:15:32.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 你不追吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.55,0:15:37.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不管我说什么她都听不进去了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.09,0:15:41.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是感觉真的有一些落寞
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.96,0:15:44.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到她竟然对我如此不信任
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.20,0:15:48.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明我的心一直都属于她一个人的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.33,0:15:53.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听起来好像是在说他是冤枉的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.10,0:15:55.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的是冤枉的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.48,0:15:59.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,志麻 救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.84,0:16:01.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.31,0:16:03.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.45,0:16:05.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请您放过我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.12,0:16:06.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.12,0:16:09.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起在湖底生活吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.25,0:16:12.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 果然应该给它最后致命的一击
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.62,0:16:13.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶紧去追人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.21,0:16:33.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师没有追来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.78,0:16:38.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后我该怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.89,0:16:42.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs28}不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.02,0:16:44.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管发生什么事 你都要成为我的新娘
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.72,0:16:50.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是说过我已经跟弥勒法师结合了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.96,0:16:55.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会原谅你的 我可以原谅你过去的事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.00,0:16:57.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.75,0:17:15.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是弥勒法师的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.42,0:17:16.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.92,0:17:18.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.82,0:17:22.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他根本就不是来追我的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.10,0:17:29.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.97,0:17:31.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把这个人带到安全的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.67,0:17:33.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.20,0:17:35.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太愚蠢了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.27,0:17:37.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨被弹开了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.96,0:17:55.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.46,0:17:57.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看我就顺便把你带到湖底
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.73,0:18:00.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我的小妾吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.30,0:18:03.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.20,0:18:08.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.51,0:18:09.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然敢抓我的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.24,0:18:13.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.48,0:18:21.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里可是湖水之中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.72,0:18:24.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么可能会被你这个家伙抓住呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.49,0:18:31.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.93,0:18:33.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然如此 这招怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.56,0:18:34.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风穴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.95,0:18:55.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水好像…开始消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.56,0:19:06.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.88,0:19:20.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个臭鲶鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.58,0:19:23.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我警告你不准动我的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.85,0:19:27.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这个女人也是你的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.25,0:19:30.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对…对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.99,0:19:33.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.00,0:19:45.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.47,0:19:48.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.58,0:19:53.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.91,0:19:58.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在叫你呀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.85,0:19:59.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.82,0:20:01.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs28}珊瑚 等等我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.05,0:20:04.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然没有…我上场的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.39,0:20:12.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.33,0:20:17.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到头来 这只是一段无法实现的恋情
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.67,0:20:25.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 我说谎欺骗了大家
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.94,0:20:27.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟弥勒法师已经结合的事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.01,0:20:29.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是假的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.18,0:20:30.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.11,0:20:32.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我不想当鲶鱼的新娘
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.62,0:20:33.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以不知不觉就…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.18,0:20:37.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想这是志麻姑娘急中生智吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.55,0:20:39.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如…如果是那样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.39,0:20:42.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要把这个真相告诉我一个人不就好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.46,0:20:44.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.86,0:20:47.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我对你非常的信任
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.97,0:20:51.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以为不说出来你也会明白
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.20,0:20:53.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.10,0:20:57.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来这都要怪我平日行为不端吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.41,0:21:00.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你留下了不好的回忆 真是对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.88,0:21:01.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.31,0:21:05.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要再说了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.78,0:21:06.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.15,0:21:09.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你救我的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.19,0:21:12.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是觉得有点高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.59,0:21:16.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你原谅我了吗 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.96,0:21:18.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这句话应该是我要说的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.06,0:21:20.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样就好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.40,0:21:23.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚的心胸真的好宽大喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.97,0:21:27.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者应该说比戈薇宽大吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.24,0:21:34.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们很相配呢 弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.42,0:21:43.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.45,0:21:46.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是早点否认的话 就不会发生那种事了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.39,0:21:49.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道说 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.59,0:21:50.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会是为了要回想起过去的记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.16,0:21:52.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,花了很长的时间吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.96,0:21:55.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说中了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.13,0:21:58.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那样的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.27,0:21:59.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说 是那样的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.14,0:22:03.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正都是过去的事了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.30,0:22:14.14,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Brand-New World 全新梦想的起点{\fad(0,200)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.31,0:22:21.15,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝向目标持续旅程 直到最后{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.25,0:22:29.39,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Brand-New Mind 怀抱热情直到下一扇门扉{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.53,0:22:35.66,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冲向未知的世界 快奔驰吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.04,0:22:44.67,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伸手触摸 那微尘般的希望之星{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.77,0:22:53.41,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使勉强握住 横冲直撞的我们想往何处?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.55,0:22:59.72,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保有自我 Let's go and Try 前进吧 使命只有One way{\fad(0,25)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.62,0:23:06.69,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺其自然 Do it! Ready? 最后愿望将达成{\fad(50,200)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.80,0:23:13.67,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Brand-New World 全新梦想的起点
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.77,0:23:20.70,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝向目标持续旅程 直到最后
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.88,0:23:28.94,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Brand-New Mind 怀抱热情直到下一扇门扉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.09,0:23:35.39,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冲向未知的世界 快奔驰吧{\fad(0,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.94,0:23:52.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 邪见
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.58,0:23:54.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小玲被妖怪抓走了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.61,0:23:58.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,专门驱魔除妖的法师好像已经去救她了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.25,0:24:00.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是那位法师平生最恨妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.18,0:24:02.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是他和杀生丸碰上 事情就不妙了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.42,0:24:04.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人类那种不成气候的法术 能有什么用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.69,0:24:06.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对会被杀生丸撕成碎片的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.79,0:24:08.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一点都不害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.53,0:24:10.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.99,0:24:13.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远与杀生丸少爷在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.56,0:24:14.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.96,0:24:16.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算小玲死了 请您也不要忘记我
